      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TRACEY TARO (2) finished in the placings last time but could not have been more impressive before that in her dynamic 22.57 win at this track over 400m. Has the ability and looks hard to top. HOT TO TWIST (1) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when sixth at this track over 318m behind Kert Kert (19.10) in a Grade 4. A big run wouldn't surprise. BELL MAC MAGIC (8) has some solid form under her belt and proved too classy last time to win by 4 lengths at this track in a handy 18.48 beating Slippery Bogan. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Sure to be thereabouts. LITTLE KING (4) has ability and can find the frame.",
